<title>USA: United Shields names new president/CFO.</title>
<headline>United Shields names new president/CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Shields Corp said Tuesday it has named Richard Hughes president and Beverly Gill chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company also said it is negotiating to acquire a number of companies in the plastic manufacturing and food and beverage packaging industries.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to provide further details about the personnel moves or the potential acquisitions.</p>
</text>
